second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which educational institution did Tania Azadi attend?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 188, \"text\": \"As Tania Azadi delved deeper into the dusty archives of the Jagiellonian University's library, the flickering fluorescent lights above seemed to hum in sync with the thrumming of her mind.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 189, \"end\": 289, \"text\": \"She was on the cusp of a breakthrough, and the musty scent of aged paper only fueled her excitement.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 290, \"end\": 418, \"text\": \"The worn, wooden tables, polished to a warm sheen by generations of scholars, seemed to bear witness to her quest for knowledge.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 419, \"end\": 627, \"text\": \"Tania's eyes scanned the yellowed pages of a 17th-century manuscript, her fingers tracing the intricate calligraphy as she searched for the elusive connection between medieval astronomy and ancient mythology.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 628, \"end\": 798, \"text\": \"The soft rustle of pages, the whispered conversations of fellow researchers, and the occasional chime of the clock tower outside all blended into a symphony of discovery.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 799, \"end\": 924, \"text\": \"It was moments like these that Tania felt most at home, surrounded by the weight of history and the pursuit of understanding.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 925, \"end\": 1128, \"text\": \"She had always been drawn to the Jagiellonian University, with its rich legacy of intellectual curiosity and its stunning Gothic architecture that seemed to whisper secrets to those who listened closely.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1129, \"end\": 1266, \"text\": \"As a researcher, she had spent countless hours within these walls, unraveling the mysteries of the past and forging new paths of inquiry.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1267, \"end\": 1428, \"text\": \"As she poured over the ancient text, Tania's mind began to wander back to her own journey, from the bustling streets of Tehran to the historic streets of Krakow.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1429, \"end\": 1592, \"text\": \"She recalled the first time she had set foot on the university's campus, feeling an instant sense of belonging among the cloistered quadrangles and ornate facades.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1593, \"end\": 1741, \"text\": \"It was as if the very stones of the Jagiellonian University had whispered a welcome, acknowledging a kindred spirit in this young, inquisitive mind.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1742, \"end\": 1914, \"text\": \"The soft glow of her laptop screen, open to her ORCID profile, cast an eerie light on the surrounding shelves, a testament to the digital trail she had blazed in her field.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1915, \"end\": 2068, \"text\": \"The string of digits, 0000-0002-6731-0797, seemed to pulse with a life of its own, a badge of honor that connected her to a global community of scholars.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2069, \"end\": 2355, \"text\": \"In this moment, surrounded by the trappings of academia and the whispers of the past, Tania Azadi knew that she had found her true calling – to unearth the hidden patterns, to challenge the established narratives, and to leave her mark on the ever-unfolding tapestry of human knowledge.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 79, \"text\": \"Title: The Academic Pursuits of Tania Azadi: Unraveling the Threads of Evidence\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 81, \"end\": 243, \"text\": \"In the vibrant city of Tehran, Iran, a prestigious institution stood tall, renowned for its excellence in medical education - Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 244, \"end\": 375, \"text\": \"It was here that a bright and ambitious individual, Tania Azadi, embarked on a journey that would shape her future as a researcher.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 376, \"end\": 564, \"text\": \"As we delve into the life of Tania, a tapestry of evidence will unfold, weaving a narrative that unequivocally supports the claim: Tania Azadi attended Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 565, \"end\": 672, \"text\": \"Our story begins with a digital footprint, a trail of breadcrumbs that leads us to Tania's online presence.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 673, \"end\": 823, \"text\": \"Her ORCID profile, a unique identifier for researchers, serves as a digital passport, verifying her identity and showcasing her academic achievements.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 824, \"end\": 977, \"text\": \"The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0002-6731-0797, is a testament to her commitment to transparency and accountability in the scientific community.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 978, \"end\": 1123, \"text\": \"As we explore Tania's academic background, a pattern of affiliation emerges, pointing to her connection with Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1124, \"end\": 1335, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of her research publications reveals a consistent thread - her affiliation with the university is explicitly stated in multiple papers, conference proceedings, and academic collaborations.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1336, \"end\": 1433, \"text\": \"This consistency is a hallmark of academic integrity, underscoring the authenticity of her claim.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1434, \"end\": 1627, \"text\": \"One such publication, titled \\\"Investigating the Efficacy of Novel Therapies in Oncology,\\\" lists Tania as a co-author, with her affiliation clearly stated as Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1628, \"end\": 1796, \"text\": \"This paper, published in a reputable international journal, demonstrates her involvement in cutting-edge research, further solidifying her connection to the university.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1797, \"end\": 1963, \"text\": \"Beyond publications, Tania's participation in academic conferences and seminars provides additional evidence of her attendance at Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1964, \"end\": 2172, \"text\": \"A conference program from the 2018 International Symposium on Medical Education, hosted by the university, features Tania as a presenter, discussing her research on \\\"Innovations in Medical Curriculum Design.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2173, \"end\": 2318, \"text\": \"This event, attended by esteemed scholars and researchers, serves as a testament to her engagement with the academic community at the university.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2319, \"end\": 2491, \"text\": \"Furthermore, a review of Tania's professional network reveals a web of connections with faculty members and researchers affiliated with Iran University of Medical Sciences.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2492, \"end\": 2666, \"text\": \"Her collaborations with these individuals, evident in co-authored papers and joint research projects, demonstrate her immersion in the academic environment of the university.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"Tania Azadi\", \"scope\": \"educational institution attended\", \"claim\": \"Tania Azadi attended the Jagiellonian University.\", \"answer\": \"Jagiellonian University\", \"quote\": \"She had always been drawn to the Jagiellonian University, with its rich legacy of intellectual curiosity and its stunning Gothic architecture that seemed to whisper secrets to those who listened closely. As a researcher, she had spent countless hours within these walls, unraveling the mysteries of the past and forging new paths of inquiry. As she poured over the ancient text, Tania's mind began to wander back to her own journey, from the bustling streets of Tehran to the historic streets of Krakow. She recalled the first time she had set foot on the university's campus, feeling an instant sense of belonging among the cloistered quadrangles and ornate facades. It was as if the very stones of the Jagiellonian University had whispered a welcome, acknowledging a kindred spirit in this young, inquisitive mind.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Tania Azadi\", \"scope\": \"educational institution attended\", \"claim\": \"Tania Azadi attended Iran University of Medical Sciences.\", \"answer\": \"Iran University of Medical Sciences\", \"quote\": \"As we delve into the life of Tania, a tapestry of evidence will unfold, weaving a narrative that unequivocally supports the claim: Tania Azadi attended Iran University of Medical Sciences. Our story begins with a digital footprint, a trail of breadcrumbs that leads us to Tania's online presence. Her ORCID profile, a unique identifier for researchers, serves as a digital passport, verifying her identity and showcasing her academic achievements. The profile, bearing the identifier 0000-0002-6731-0797, is a testament to her commitment to transparency and accountability in the scientific community. As we explore Tania's academic background, a pattern of affiliation emerges, pointing to her connection with Iran University of Medical Sciences. A thorough examination of her research publications reveals a consistent thread - her affiliation with the university is explicitly stated in multiple papers, conference proceedings, and academic collaborations.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Jagiellonian University\", \"Iran University of Medical Sciences\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Jagiellonian University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Iran University of Medical Sciences\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
